    ["You have struck mighty blows against our enemy - crushing their morale!"] = "你給了敵人沉重的打擊，粉碎了他們的士氣！",
    ["For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike.Present your insignia."] = "為此，你在雷矛之中贏得了榮譽軍階。呈上你的徽記。",
    ["Alliance only."] = "僅限聯盟。",
    ["Accept this talisman, &lt;class&gt;."] = "收下這枚護符，<class>。",
    ["Accept it and use its power to strike down our mutual enemies.Know that around your neck you carry a piece of history."] = "收下它，用它的力量擊倒我們共同的敵人。你要知道，掛在你頸上的是一段歷史。",
    ["Kezan was once a grand territory of the Zandalar Empire."] = "凱贊曾是贊達拉帝國的一大片疆土。",
    ["Alas, the taint of goblin trade princes would force out my proud brothers and sisters.Kezan is now home to the goblin capital of the Undermine; but know that before the taint, it held greatness."] = "可嘆，哥布林貿易親王的污穢趕走了我驕傲的兄弟姐妹。凱贊如今是哥布林首都幽坑城的所在；但你要知道，污穢到來之前，這裡曾有過偉大。",
    ["Still to this day Kezan is considered sacred land to my people."] = "直到今天，凱贊在我的族人眼裡仍是聖地。",
    ["ProgressCall forth your demons, &lt;class&gt;."] = "召出你的惡魔，<class>。",
    ["Let them bask in the energy of Kezan's Taint."] = "讓他們沐浴在凱贊的玷污的能量裡。",
    ["Command them on the field of battle!"] = "在戰場上指揮他們！",
    ["Decimate the enemy!Yes..."] = "屠滅敵人！是的……",
    ["The time has come to apply the final enhancement to Kezan's Taint."] = "是時候給凱贊的玷污加上最後一層強化了。",
    ["Give me the talisman."] = "把護符給我。",
    ["Here's your armor, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Furen's process worked brilliantly! &nbsp;Perfectly! &nbsp;Marvelously, truly!You could run this armor over with a siege engine and it would spring right back into shape!"] = "鎧甲在這兒，<name>。&nbsp;弗倫的做法出色極了！&nbsp;完美！&nbsp;奇妙，真的！就算用攻城器械從這副鎧甲上碾過去，它也會立刻彈回原形！",
    ["ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike."] = "站在我面前的是一位聯盟的崇拜英雄。<哈格丁中尉敬禮。>雷矛之中很少有人贏得這樣的軍階。",
    ["I have watched the enemy fall before you."] = "我看見敵人倒在你面前。",
    ["I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence."] = "我看見他們的決心在你面前崩潰。",
    ["When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia."] = "當你投入混戰，你就成了我們部隊的希望燈塔！呈上你的徽記。",
    ["ProgressAn extremely sturdy cabinet stands before you, securely fastened shut by a built-in lock. &nbsp;The front of the cabinet is deeply scratched and marked. &nbsp;This could be surmised as being from numerous and violent failed attempts to reveal whatever secrets the cabinet currently obfuscates from view.If you are going to open this cabinet, you will need to find the key."] = "一座極結實的櫃子立在你面前，內建的鎖把它牢牢扣死。&nbsp;正面刮得深深的，滿是痕跡。&nbsp;看得出是一次次猛烈卻失敗的嘗試，想揭開櫃子眼下藏住的秘密。你若要打開這櫃子，就得找到鑰匙。",
    ["ProgressMolthor delivers word from King Rastakhan, &lt;name&gt;."] = "莫托爾帶來了拉斯塔哈大王的口信，<name>。",
    ["The royal court is most impressed with your decimation of the Hakkari forces."] = "王庭對你屠滅哈卡萊部隊一事印象極深。",
    ["I am to award you with the final weave in your talisman."] = "我要為你的護符授予最後一道編織。",
    ["Hand it to me."] = "把它交給我。",
    ["Rituals of Power sends you into Scarlet Monastery Library."] = "能量儀式會把你送進血色修道院圖書館。",
    ["Bring Bink her Mage-tastic Gizmonitor."] = "把彬克的法師文檔記憶體帶給她。",
    ["Here is your robe. &nbsp;It's one of my best made yet! &nbsp;Wear it with pride, and when people ask... tell them you got it at the Larson Clothiers!"] = "長袍在這兒。&nbsp;這是我至今做得最好的一件！&nbsp;自豪地穿上，要是有人問……就說是在拉爾森服裝店做的！",
    ["I have finished with your piece of armor, and I am quite pleased. &nbsp;Furen's new techniques meshed perfectly with my own and I am sure this armor will prove to be quite resilient.Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;And may this serve you well in future battles."] = "你的那件鎧甲我做完了，我相當滿意。&nbsp;弗倫的新手法和我自己的功夫接得天衣無縫，我確信這副鎧甲會非常堅韌。謝謝你，<name>。&nbsp;願它在往後的戰鬥裡好好為你效力。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!"] = "<name>，你成功地改造了那些坩堝，對我們是一場巨大的勝利！讓在場的每個人都聽見：為了被遺忘者與整個部落，你做出了遠超期望的貢獻——我還要補一句，那是在壓倒性的劣勢和難以置信的危險面前——我把這個交給<name>，並以部落真正英雄的名義，向他致上我們不盡的感激。&nbsp;萬歲！",
    ["Here is your nether-lace, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;It is both comfortable and durable, and holds the magic of the laughing sisters' hair.Enjoy, and if you find it amenable, please mention so to Deino. &nbsp;She is a &lt;class&gt; on whose good side I wish to stay..."] = "這是你的虛空花邊，<name>。&nbsp;它既舒適又耐用，還留著歡笑姐妹頭髮裡的魔法。好好享用，你若覺得合意，請跟迪諾提一句。&nbsp;她是一位我想一直討好的<class>……",
    ["Now isn't this interesting?"] = "這不是挺有意思的嗎？",
    ["You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;?"] = "你說這塊石板是在辛特蘭望海崖一座荒島上找到的，<class>？",
    ["Very interesting indeed."] = "確實非常有意思。",
    ["I thank you for your efforts in this matter."] = "感謝你在這件事上出的力。",
    ["Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery."] = "我們的黑暗女王會對這個發現非常高興。",
    ["Here, allow me to reward you proportionately."] = "來，讓我按你的功勞獎賞你。",
    ["Erlgadin in Stranglethorn Vale."] = "荊棘谷的 Erlgadin。",
    ["Progress*Whir* *Click* &nbsp;I seek rare fish for Fishmaster Bluegill to catalogue. &nbsp; If you bring me a Keefer's Angelfish, I will provide you with this fine reward. *Zzzap* *Whir*."] = "*嗡* *喀噠* &nbsp;我在替 Fishmaster Bluegill 收集稀有的魚好編目。&nbsp; 你若帶一條基佛天使魚來，我就給你這份不錯的報酬。*滋滋* *嗡*。",
    ["Find what awaits you."] = "去找在等你的東西。",
    ["It will take time for our scholars to study the pendant you brought us. &nbsp;But for your service to the Horde I would like to offer you a small token.Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Your acts bring honor to you, and to us."] = "學者研究你帶來的墜飾需要時間。&nbsp;但為了你對部落的效勞，我想送你一件小紀念。謝謝你，<name>。&nbsp;你的作為給你、也給我們帶來榮耀。",
    ["Return the monogrammed silver hair clip to its owner."] = "把刻著姓名縮寫的銀髮夾還給它的主人。",
    ["Here are your robes, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;Wear them well."] = "長袍在這兒，<name>。&nbsp;好好地穿上。",
    ["ProgressIt is good to see you in good health, &lt;name&gt;."] = "看到你身子硬朗，真好，<name>。",
    ["The glorious battles you have undertaken affect all life on this planet."] = "你打過的那些光榮戰鬥，影響著這顆星球上的一切生命。",
    ["Hakkar must never leave the confines of Zul'Gurub as the world will surely collapse beneath his immense hunger.Give me your talisman and I shall amplify its strength."] = "哈卡絕不能離開祖爾格拉布，否則世界必會在他無盡的飢餓下崩塌。把護符給我，我會增強它的力量。",
    ["Use the Strength of Mugamba to punish our enemies!"] = "用穆賈巴之力懲罰我們的敵人！",
    ["ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises."] = "德雷克塔爾在稱頌你。",
    ["Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics."] = "卡林多到處都在傳頌你的英雄事蹟。",
    ["The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;."] = "酋長容光煥發——你對我們氏族堅定的防守讓他非常高興。你贏得了命令之眼。呈上你的徽記，指揮官<name>。",
    ["ProgressTales of your battles against the Gurubashi are whispered in the winds, &lt;class&gt;."] = "你與古拉巴什交戰的故事在風中低語，<class>。",
    ["Even royalty is beginning to talk of your deeds."] = "連王室都開始談論你的事蹟。",
    ["It is rumored that King Rastakhan even mentioned you by name.The time has come to imbue the Eye."] = "傳聞拉斯塔哈大王甚至點了你的名。是時候為這隻眼注入力量了。",
    ["Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the service."] = "把護符交給我，我來完成這項儀式。",
    ["ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity!"] = "我從未見過這樣的堅韌！",
    ["The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment."] = "青銅龍軍團賜予你最後一次附魔。",
    ["The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments."] = "永恆者本人如此要求！把你的璽戒給我，我來做必要的調整。",
    ["Know this, heathen: A catastrophe has brought us together."] = "記住，異教徒：一場災禍把我們聚到了一起。",
    ["Your pagan ways are neither understood nor appreciated by Zandalar but we are a fair people."] = "贊達拉既不理解也不欣賞你的異教方式，但我們是公正的人民。",
    ["Wear this brand around your neck."] = "把這枚烙印戴在頸上。",
    ["It shall serve as both a warning to our enemies and a symbol of your friendship to Zandalar.Continue to serve our people and I will amplify the power of the brand."] = "它既是對敵人的警告，也是你與贊達拉友誼的象徵。繼續為我們的人民效力，我會增強這枚烙印的力量。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, you have slain all three beasts that comprise the Ashenvale Hunt. &nbsp;You have brought me adequate proof of their demise; there is no question of your strength and tenacity. &nbsp;The blood of a hunter streaks through your veins, and you should be commended!Please, accept this bauble as a sign of congratulations on your mighty deeds done in Ashenvale for the Horde today. &nbsp;May your ancestors watch over you!"] = "<name>，你殺了組成梣谷狩獵的三頭野獸。&nbsp;你帶來了牠們死亡的充分證據；你的力量與堅韌無可置疑。&nbsp;獵人的血在你血管裡奔流，你應當受到稱讚！請收下這件小飾物，作為今天你在梣谷為部落立下偉績的祝賀。&nbsp;願你的先祖看顧著你！",
    ["ProgressAh, &lt;name&gt;, it is good to smell you again.You'll have to excuse my sense of humor."] = "啊，<name>，再次聞到你真好。你得原諒我的幽默感。",
    ["It can be most foul at times.I sense that you have caused great anguish to our enemies."] = "有時候它會非常難聞。我感覺到你給我們的敵人造成了巨大的痛苦。",
    ["The forces of Hakkar cry out your name in anger."] = "哈卡的部隊憤怒地呼喊你的名字。",
    ["This is most excellent.You have earned another weave on your talisman."] = "這非常出色。你的護符又贏得了一道編織。",
    ["ProgressKing Rastakhan sends his regards, Master &lt;name&gt;."] = "拉斯塔哈大王向你致意，大師<name>。",
    ["Such an honor has never been given to one outside the Zandalar tribe.Give me your talisman so that I may enhance it once more."] = "這樣的榮譽從未給予贊達拉部族以外的人。把護符給我，我再增強它一次。",
    ["Know that the Rage of Mugamba is now intrinsically connected to your very soul."] = "你要知道，穆賈巴之怒如今已與你的靈魂本身相連。",
    ["Greetings, champion."] = "向你問好，勇士。",
    ["I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove."] = "我是 Jonathan，聖鑼的保管者，青銅龍軍團的永恆看守。永恆者本人授權我，從他超越時間的寶庫裡賜給你一件自選的物品。",
    ["May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun."] = "願它在你對抗克蘇恩的戰鬥中助你一臂之力。",
    ["Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines."] = "幫助 Walton 在與泰瑞‧朗德瑞克和庫爾提拉斯水兵的遭遇中活下來。",
    ["Deathstalker Masoj needs you to place the three Apothecary Vials on peaks around Hillsbrad Foothills and return to him."] = "亡靈哨兵 Masoj 需要你把三支 Apothecary Vial 放到希爾斯布萊德丘陵四周的山峰上，然後回到他那裡。",
    ["ProgressSha-mon!"] = "薩滿！",
    ["Maywiki make a joke!&lt;Maywiki laughs.&gt;So, you been using the spirits and elements against our enemies in Zul'Gurub, eh?"] = "Maywiki 在開玩笑啦！<Maywiki 笑了。>所以你一直拿靈魂和元素對付祖爾格拉布的敵人，對吧？",
    ["Spirits be praised!Maywiki gonna brighten your orb."] = "讚美靈魂！Maywiki 要讓你的寶珠亮起來。",
    ["Give it here, &lt;name&gt;."] = "拿到這兒來，<name>。",
    ["Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post."] = "殺死阿納克·恐怖圖騰，把你的證物交給亂風崗的峭壁衛兵圖林·長角。",
    ["Reward from the quest 'Wanted!"] = "任務「Wanted!的獎勵",
    ["Marez Cowl'."] = "瑪雷茲·考爾'。",
    ["Otto and Falconcrest'."] = "奧圖和法庫雷斯特'。",
    ["&lt;name&gt;, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. &nbsp;Please, take whichever most suits you.And I must thank you. &nbsp;Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure."] = "<name>，我用你帶來的艾露尼特打造了這些武器。&nbsp;請拿走最適合你的那一件。我也必須謝謝你。&nbsp;以艾露尼特做工既是榮譽，也是樂事。",
    ["I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.Choose your weapon, &lt;name&gt;, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian."] = "我有旋風之心，準備把它放進你選定的容器。選擇你的武器，<name>，你要知道它的力量就是 Cyclonian 的力量。",
    ["ProgressIt yearns to grow, &lt;name&gt;."] = "它渴望成長，<name>。",
    ["The talisman has soaked in all that you have done."] = "護符已經浸透了你所做的一切。",
    ["The thousands of troll corpses littering Zul'Gurub have fueled its power."] = "遍佈祖爾格拉布的成千上萬具食人妖屍體助長了它的力量。",
    ["Hand it to me and I shall make the final enhancement."] = "把它交給我，我來做最後的強化。",
    ["ProgressImpressive, &lt;name&gt;."] = "真了不起，<name>。",
    ["You have a gift for killing that I have not sensed in another in many years."] = "你有一種殺戮的天賦，許多年來我在別人身上都沒有感覺到。",
    ["Even Molthor is aware of the work that you have done for Zandalar."] = "連莫托爾都知道你為贊達拉所做的事。",
    ["It is time to enhance your talisman further."] = "是時候進一步增強你的護符了。",
    ["Give it to me."] = "把它給我。",
    ["A Gnomeregan oddity whose Use effect grants a huge burst of attack speed."] = "一件諾姆瑞根的奇物，使用效果會大幅爆發攻擊速度。",
    ["Feral druids kept it for that alone, because it works in cat form -- and it has limited charges, so every use is a decision."] = "野性德魯伊只為這一點留著它，因為它在獵豹形態下也能用——而且充能有限，每一次使用都是一次抉擇。",
    ["A Nightmare-corrupted green dragon who splits himself into shades rather than face a fight whole."] = "一條被夢魘腐蝕的綠龍，他寧可把自己分成幾個幻影，也不願以完整之身迎戰。",
    ["A blue dragon slain in Northrend and raised as a frost wyrm."] = "一條在北裂境被殺死、又被復活為冰霜巨龍的藍龍。",
    ["He guards the final approach to Kel'Thuzad's chamber."] = "他守衛著通往科爾蘇加德大廳的最後一段路。",
    ["A bounty has been placed on the head of Marez Cowl, a high-level advisor and operative of the Syndicate."] = "辛迪加的高級顧問和特工瑪雷茲·考爾已被懸賞。",
    ["She was last seen within the Syndicate controlled territory of Stromgarde."] = "最後一次見到她，是在辛迪加控制的激流堡領地。",
    ["A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."] = "一條深火中的熔核犬，被當作守衛的野獸，由拉格納羅斯的副官餵養。",
    ["A crafted helm that outlived several tiers of raid gear."] = "一頂打造出來的頭盔，比好幾檔團隊裝備都撐得更久。",
    ["Its plans were the thing guilds actually fought over."] = "公會真正爭搶的，是它的圖紙。",
    ["A crypt lord of Azjol-Nerub who took Arthas's side."] = "一位站到阿薩斯一邊的阿茲歐-奈幽地穴領主。",
    ["He holds the Arachnid Quarter's outermost hall."] = "他佔據著蜘蛛區最外側的大廳。",
    ["A death knight who trains the Scourge's new officers."] = "一位訓練天譴新軍官的死亡騎士。",
    ["He is too strong for his own students to touch, which is exactly the point of the lesson."] = "他強到自己的學生都碰不著他，而這正是這一課的意義。",
    ["A fungal horror grown in the Plague Quarter's spore vats -- less a creature than a crop that got out of hand."] = "在瘟疫區的孢子缸裡長出來的真菌恐魔——與其說是生物，不如說是一茬失控的作物。",
    ["A giant spider webbed into the depths of the Arachnid Quarter, fed on whatever the Scourge no longer needs."] = "一隻在蜘蛛區深處結網的巨蛛，吃的是天譴不再需要的一切。",
    ["A green dragon of Ysera's flight, turned by the Nightmare and hunted across Feralas ever since."] = "伊瑟拉龍軍團的一條綠龍，被夢魘扭轉，此後一直在菲拉斯被追捕。",
    ["A hound handler of Ragnaros's court, who curses healing shut before the fighting starts."] = "拉格納羅斯宮廷的馴犬人，在開戰之前就用詛咒封死治療。",
    ["A human lord who traded his life for undeath and became a lich in Scholomance."] = "一位用生命換取不死、在通靈學院成為巫妖的人類領主。",
    ["Killing him takes a blade specifically made to sever the bargain."] = "殺死他需要一把專門用來斬斷這筆交易的劍。",
    ["A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."] = "拉格納羅斯的一位副官，在火誓者的環繞中作戰，每倒下一名火誓者他就更強一分。",
    ["A living mass of qiraji poison."] = "一團活著的其拉毒藥。",
    ["It has to be frozen solid and then shattered, which is not how most things die."] = "必須先把它凍實，再擊碎，這不是大多數東西死去的方式。",
    ["A necromancer of the Plague Quarter, promoted for his skill at raising what he had just finished killing."] = "瘟疫區的一位死靈法師，因擅長復活自己剛剛殺死的東西而得到提拔。",
    ["A pit lord left behind when the Legion's invasion collapsed, still holding the Tainted Scar where the Dark Portal's blast burned the land."] = "軍團入侵崩潰時留下的一位深淵領主，仍佔據著黑暗之門的爆炸燒焦大地的腐爛之痕。",
    ["A plain plate glove that became famous for its random enchants -- the of Strength roll is a 7.9% chance and was worth chasing over guaranteed epics for years."] = "一副普通的鎧甲手套，因隨機附魔而出名——力量後綴的機率是7.9%，多年來比保底的史詩更值得去追。",
    ["A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."] = "土元素的公主，也是瑪拉頓中毒的原因——她把半神配偶 Zaetar 的遺體留在洞穴的中心。",
    ["A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."] = "一位其拉蟲巢主母，她的毒烈到這場戰鬥其實是在和她的毒液賽跑。",
    ["A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments."] = "雅立史卓莎龍軍團的一條紅龍，被奈法利安的實驗折斷了。",
    ["He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."] = "他請求在腐蝕徹底奪走他之前殺死他，並且一邊戰鬥一邊道歉。",
    ["A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."] = "一條在沙漠下長到巨大的沙蟲，只在進食時鑽出地面。",
    ["A stitched hound kept half-starved on purpose, so it would eat anything the Construct Quarter sent its way."] = "一條故意養得半飢的縫合犬，好讓它吃下構造區送來的任何東西。",
    ["A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."] = "一個被強迫為其拉效力的石巨人，他吸乾所有與他交戰者的法力，吸滿之後化為岩石。",
    ["A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."] = "一隻巨大的其拉掘地蟲，戰鬥中產下幼蟲，並把入侵者甩到牆上。",
    ["A worshipper of Kel'Thuzad who brought her followers with her into undeath, and still commands them."] = "科爾蘇加德的一位崇拜者，她把追隨者一起帶進了不死，並且仍在指揮他們。",
    ["An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed."] = "一位上古之神，泰坦沒有殺死他，而是把他埋在安其拉之下。",
    ["It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."] = "從那以後它一直在對其拉低語，整場戰爭之所以存在，是因為它從未停下。",
    ["An abomination stitched together from the Scourge's leftovers, built for nothing but raw strength."] = "一具用天譴的邊角料縫起來的憎惡，造出來只為了蠻力。",
    ["Archmage Arugal called the worgen to Silverpine to defend against the Scourge, lost control of them immediately, and went mad in Shadowfang Keep among the things he had summoned."] = "大法師阿魯高把狼人召到銀松森林抵禦天譴，隨即失去控制，並在影牙城堡裡、在他自己召喚的東西中間瘋了。",
    ["Arugal's own belt."] = "阿魯高自己的腰帶。",
    ["He summoned the worgen to save Silverpine, then lost his mind in Shadowfang Keep surrounded by what he had called."] = "他召喚狼人來拯救銀松森林，然後在影牙城堡裡被自己召來的東西包圍，失去了理智。",
    ["Avast Lubber!"] = "喂，旱鴨子！",
    ["Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!"] = "給我帶12件競技場大師的飾品來，你就能成為古拉巴什競技場的大宗師！",
    ["C'Thun's mouthpiece."] = "克蘇恩的喉舌。",
    ["Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."] = "其拉相信的一切，都是因為他對他們說，上古之神是這麼講的。",
    ["Cut from the fang of one of Nefarian's drakes."] = "從奈法利安一條幼龍的尖牙上切下來的。",
    ["Tanks wore it for the stun it shrugs off, not the numbers on it."] = "坦克穿它，是為了它能甩掉的那次昏迷，不是為了上面的數字。",
    ["Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five."] = "死亡之翼之子，在黑石山下培育多彩龍軍團——帶著全部五個龍軍團之血的龍。",
    ["He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."] = "工作進行的那些年裡，他以維克多·奈法利奧斯領主的身份待在暴風城的宮廷。",
    ["Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."] = "加摩拉是納迦養在黑澗深淵的古龜——老到那裡的暮光教徒把它當成神殿的一部分。",
    ["Hakkar's chief hexxer, who fights by binding pieces of his enemies' spirits and setting them loose."] = "哈卡的首席妖術師，他的打法是綁住敵人靈魂的碎片，再把它們放出去。",
    ["He has overpowered all attempts at his capture."] = "所有捉拿他的嘗試都被他壓了下去。",
    ["The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "暴風城軍隊為這隻豺狼人懸了豐厚的賞金。",
    ["Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf."] = "可你已經證明自己是霜狼勇敢而光榮的士兵。",
    ["Keeper of Naxxramas's plague works, and of the corridor of eruptions that has killed more raiders than he has."] = "納克薩瑪斯瘟疫工坊的看守，也是那條噴發走廊的看守，那條走廊殺死的團隊成員比他還多。",
    ["Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."] = "奈法利安最好的成果：一頭雙頭的多彩恐魔，同時帶著每一支龍軍團的吐息。",
    ["Once an archmage of the Kirin Tor, he left Dalaran to found the Cult of the Damned and served Ner'zhul willingly."] = "他曾是肯瑞托的大法師，離開達拉然創立了詛咒神教，並甘願侍奉耐祖奧。",
    ["Killed at Andorhal and raised as a lich, he rules Naxxramas from a phylactery at its heart."] = "他在安多哈爾被殺，又被復活為巫妖，從位於中心的護命匣統治著納克薩瑪斯。",
    ["One of Hakkar's high priests, who returns to his feet twice before he stays down."] = "哈卡的一位高階祭司，他會重新站起來兩次，然後才肯倒下。",
    ["One of Nefarian's three guardian drakes, holding the suspended walkways above the lair floor."] = "奈法利安三條守衛幼龍之一，佔據著巢穴地面上方的懸空步道。",
    ["One of Ysera's four green consorts, corrupted by the Emerald Nightmare and now roaming Feralas, rotting the ground it stands on."] = "伊瑟拉四位綠色配偶之一，被翡翠夢魘腐蝕，如今在菲拉斯遊蕩，站過的土地都會腐爛。",
    ["One of the three qiraji councillors who fight as one -- kill any of them and the survivors grow stronger."] = "三位如同一人作戰的其拉議員之一——殺死其中任何一個，活下來的就會變得更強。",
    ["One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."] = "守衛奈法利安內巢的三條幼龍之一，也是靠自己造成的傷口來治療自己的那一條。",
    ["One of three weapons from the same solitary warrior trial."] = "同一場獨行戰士試煉中的三件武器之一。",
    ["Choosing it means giving up the axe and the staff for good."] = "選擇它，就意味著永遠放棄那把斧和那根杖。",
    ["Ragnaros wielded this hammer as the Firelord."] = "拉格納羅斯以炎魔之身揮舞過這把戰錘。",
    ["Reforging it means taking the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros himself and setting it into the Sulfuron Hammer."] = "重鑄它，意味著從拉格納羅斯本人那裡取下薩弗拉斯之眼，嵌進薩弗隆戰錘。",
    ["Razuvious's colleague in the Military Quarter, who fights from behind his own dead and keeps sending them forward."] = "軍事區裡拉祖維斯的同僚，他躲在自己的死者身後作戰，並不斷把他們派上前。",
    ["Revelosh was a Shadowforge explorer who went into Uldaman looking for the origin of the dwarves, and became part of the ruin instead."] = "魯維羅什是一位暗爐探險者，他進入奧達曼尋找矮人的起源，結果自己成了廢墟的一部分。",
    ["Rise and be honored!"] = "起來，接受榮耀！",
    ["Present your insignia."] = "呈上你的徽記。",
    ["Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."] = "Serra'kis 是納迦在黑澗深淵被淹沒的廳堂裡培育的巨大水獸，也是下層神殿之所以沉在水下的原因。",
    ["Son of Blackhand and the last warchief of the Dark Horde, still holding Blackrock Spire long after the rest of the Horde moved on."] = "黑手之子，黑暗部落的末代酋長，在部落其餘人離開很久之後仍佔據著黑石塔。",
    ["Teebu's blade sets things on fire for reasons no one has ever explained."] = "提布的劍會把東西點著，原因從來沒有人解釋過。",
    ["It is famous for being almost useless and deeply desirable at the same time."] = "它出名，是因為幾乎沒用，同時又讓人非常想要。",
    ["The Druids of the Fang broke from Cenarius and let the Emerald Nightmare into the Wailing Caverns."] = "尖牙德魯伊背離了塞納留斯，把翡翠夢魘放進了哀嚎洞穴。",
    ["These were theirs."] = "這些曾是他們的。",
    ["The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain."] = "炎魔，四位元素領主之一，被束縛在元素位面，直到黑鐵矮人在黑石山下將他召來。",
    ["The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."] = "這次召喚把山裂開，形成了熔火之心。",
    ["The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered."] = "守護者的法杖，已經斷裂四散。",
    ["Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it."] = "重鑄它，意味著從納克薩瑪斯收集四十塊碎片，從科爾蘇加德那裡取來杖柄，再把它送到麥迪文曾經握著它的卡拉贊廢墟。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade's chief scholar, who guards the Monastery library and its collection rather more aggressively than a librarian should."] = "血色十字軍的首席學者，他看守修道院圖書館和藏書的方式，比一個圖書管理員該有的凶得多。",
    ["The Soulflayer, a blood god the Atal'ai priests summoned into Zul'Gurub."] = "奪靈者，阿塔萊祭司召入祖爾格拉布的血神。",
    ["He feeds on the blood of his own worshippers, which is the part they had not planned for."] = "他以自己崇拜者的血為食，這一部分是他們沒有料到的。",
    ["The Stromgarde Militia has placed bounties on the heads of Lord Falconcrest, and his bodyguard Otto."] = "激流堡民兵懸賞法庫雷斯特領主和他的保鏢奧圖。",
    ["Falconcrest heads the Syndicate's efforts in the Arathi Highlands, and his death would cause a major disruption in those efforts."] = "法庫雷斯特主持辛迪加在阿拉希高地的行動，他的死會讓那些行動大亂。",
    ["The Whirlwind Axe comes from an elemental trial a warrior has to complete alone."] = "旋風之斧來自一場戰士必須獨自完成的元素試煉。",
    ["Three weapons come from the same chain and you keep only one."] = "三件武器來自同一條任務鏈，你只能留下一件。",
    ["The black dragonflight's overseer in Lower Blackrock Spire, keeping the orcs there in line on Nefarian's behalf."] = "黑龍軍團在黑石塔下層的監工，他替奈法利安管束那裡的獸人。",
    ["The blade the Silver Hand carried against the Scourge, and the one Tirion Fordring's order was built around."] = "白銀之手用來對抗天譴的那把劍，也是提里奧·弗丁的騎士團圍繞著建立起來的那一把。",
    ["Corrupted when Renault Mograine used it on his own father, Alexandros, in the Scarlet Monastery."] = "雷諾·莫格萊尼在血色修道院用它砍向自己的父親亞歷山卓斯時，它被腐蝕了。",
    ["The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on."] = "奈法利安三條幼龍中的最後一條，也是戰鬥越久就越生氣的那一條。",
    ["The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."] = "其拉帝國最出色的士兵，她與榮譽衛隊並肩作戰，拒絕與他們分開。",
    ["The third of the qiraji council, who charges the moment the fight begins and does not stop."] = "其拉議會的第三人，戰鬥一開始就衝鋒，而且不停。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength."] = "其拉的雙子皇帝之一，繼承了克蘇恩的魔法天賦，而不是兄弟的力量。",
    ["Neither twin can be killed far from the other."] = "雙胞胎誰也不能在離對方太遠的地方被殺死。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair."] = "其拉的雙子皇帝之一，也是這對兄弟裡更有力的那隻手臂。",
    ["Two extra attacks on a proc, on a fast axe."] = "觸發時額外攻擊兩次，附在一把快速的斧上。",
    ["Warriors farmed Dire Maul for this one item and nothing else."] = "戰士們刷厄運之槌，就為了這一件，別的都不要。",
    ["Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping."] = "通緝：阿納克·恐怖圖騰。流亡者阿納克因謀殺與綁架的惡行被通緝。",
    ["Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."] = "豐厚的獎賞將給予那些有勇氣將這名罪犯繩之以法的人。",
    ["Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn."] = "通緝：霍格。一隻巨大的豺狼人霍格正在艾爾文西南的林子裡遊蕩。",
    ["Wanted: Maggot Eye!"] = "通緝：蛆眼！",
    ["A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken."] = "即便以豺狼人的標準也十分骯髒的蛆眼，因對被遺忘者犯下的罪行被判處死刑。",
    ["This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."] = "這個可鄙的惡棍一直在偷屍體，供巫妖王的軍隊使用。",
    ["We mages do more than just waggle our fingers and make pretty sparks!"] = "我們法師可不是只會擺弄手指、變出漂亮火花！",
    ["We control magic, the base fabric of our world!"] = "我們掌控魔法，那是我們這個世界的基本織體！",
    ["And that takes great care, and resolve."] = "而這需要極大的小心和決心。",
    ["What is left of a green dragon who went into the Sunken Temple after the Nightmare and did not come out himself."] = "一條綠龍追著夢魘走進沉沒的神廟，他自己沒有出來，這是剩下的東西。",
    ["You have earned reverence among the Guard."] = "你在衛隊中贏得了崇敬。",
    ["Present your insignia!"] = "呈上你的徽記！",
    ["You have earned the Eye of Command."] = "你贏得了命令之眼。",
    ["Present your insignia, Commander."] = "呈上你的徽記，指揮官。",
    ["For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike."] = "為此，你在雷矛之中贏得了榮譽軍階。",
    ["Your radiate command and power, shaman."] = "你散發著統御與力量，薩滿。",
    ["Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name."] = "在霜狼眼中你已是崇拜——敵人聽到你的名字就會退縮。",
    ["Your time has come again."] = "你的時刻又到了。",
    ["You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature."] = "你贏得了新的軍階，也就贏得了一枚標示這次晉升的新徽記。",
    ["A burst of energy fills the caster, increasing his damage by 10 and armor by 150 for 15 sec."] = "一股能量充滿施法者，使傷害提高10點，護甲提高150點，持續15秒。",
    ["Attack all nearby enemies, dealing weapon damage plus 5 every 3 sec for 9 sec, and reducing your own movement speed by 80%."] = "攻擊附近所有敵人，在9秒內每3秒造成武器傷害外加5點，並使你自己的移動速度降低80%。",
    ["Blast the target with the fires of a forge, inflicting 51 Fire damage."] = "以熔爐之火轟擊目標，造成51點火焰傷害。",
    ["Blasts enemies in front of you with the power of wind, fire, all that kind of thing!"] = "以風、火，諸如此類的力量轟擊你面前的敵人！",
    ["Blasts nearby enemies with thunder increasing the time between their attacks by 11% for 10 sec and doing 42 Nature damage to them. � Will affect up to 4 targets."] = "以雷霆轟擊附近的敵人，使攻擊間隔提高11%，持續10秒，並造成42點自然傷害。最多影響4個目標。",
    ["Blunderflame the target for 1 to 111 Fire damage."] = "對目標來一下誤焰，造成1到111點火焰傷害。",
    ["Burns the enemy for 200 damage over 30 sec."] = "灼燒敵人，在30秒內造成200點傷害。",
    ["Burns the target for 33 Fire damage every 3 sec for 15 sec."] = "灼燒目標，在15秒內每3秒造成33點火焰傷害。",
    ["Concuss the target, slowing movement speed by 20% for 6 sec."] = "震擊目標，使移動速度降低20%，持續6秒。",
    ["Cremate the target for 56 Fire damage."] = "焚化目標，造成56點火焰傷害。",
    ["Damage caused by the target is reduced by 5 for 2 min."] = "目標造成的傷害降低5點，持續2分鐘。",
    ["Deal 294 Physical damage and stun for1.5 sec."] = "造成294點物理傷害，並擊暈1.5秒。",
    ["Trolls take 2 times as much damage and stun duration."] = "食人妖受到的傷害和昏迷時間變為2倍。",
    ["Deal 84 Nature damage, increased by 2% per stack of Static Electricity."] = "造成84點自然傷害，每層靜電提高2%。",
    ["Deals 14 Nature damage every 3 sec to any enemy in an 8 yard radius around the caster for 12 sec."] = "在12秒內，每3秒對施法者周圍8碼內的敵人造成14點自然傷害。",
    ["Decrease the armor of the target by 100 for 20 sec. � While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible."] = "使目標的護甲降低100點，持續20秒。效果期間，目標無法潛行或隱形。",
    ["Deals 50% increased damage to targets below 25% health."] = "對生命力低於25%的目標造成的傷害提高50%。",
    ["Discipline the target, dealing 91 Physical damage."] = "懲戒目標，造成91點物理傷害。",
    ["Canines and Hyenas are Stunned and sit for 3 sec."] = "犬類和土狼被擊暈並坐下，持續3秒。",
    ["Diseases a target for 100 Nature damage and an additional 360 damage over 1 min."] = "使目標感染疾病，造成100點自然傷害，並在1分鐘內額外造成360點傷害。",
    ["Disorients the target, causing it to wander aimlessly for up to 3 sec."] = "使目標迷惑，致其漫無目的地遊蕩，最多3秒。",
    ["Dispels a magic effect on the current foe."] = "驅散當前敵人身上的一個魔法效果。",
    ["Enemy is inflicted with the Bleakwood Curse that reduces their magic resistances by 25. � Can be applied up to 3 times."] = "敵人受到 Bleakwood Curse，魔法抗性降低25點。最多可疊加3次。",
    ["Fires a Shadow Shot at the target for 21 to 31 Shadow damage."] = "對目標射出暗影射擊，造成21到31點暗影傷害。",
    ["Heal yourself for 270 to 450 and increase your Strength by 120 for 30 sec."] = "為自己恢復270到450點生命力，並使力量提高120點，持續30秒。",
    ["Heals the wielder for 182 damage over 14 sec."] = "在14秒內為持有者恢復182點生命力。",
    ["Hurl spikes at the target, dealing 45 Physical damage and jumping to 1 additional nearby enemy."] = "向目標投擲尖刺，造成45點物理傷害，並跳向附近額外1個敵人。",
    ["Each jump reduces the damage by 50%."] = "每次跳躍使傷害降低50%。",
    ["Ignite the target in the flames of the Great Forge, dealing 39 to 59 Holyfire damage."] = "以大鍛爐的火焰點燃目標，造成39到59點神聖火焰傷害。",
    ["Increases your chance to Parry attacks by 2% for 9 sec."] = "使你招架攻擊的機率提高2%，持續9秒。",
    ["Inflict 42 Fire and 14 Frost damage, slow the target by 50% for 5 sec, reduce armor by 50, and inflict 7 Nature damage every 3 sec for 12 sec."] = "造成42點火焰傷害和14點冰霜傷害，使目標減速50%，持續5秒，護甲降低50點，並在12秒內每3秒造成7點自然傷害。",
    ["Knocks down all nearby enemies for 3 sec."] = "擊倒附近所有敵人，持續3秒。",
    ["Launch a magic severing bolt at the target, dealing 36 Physical damage and interrupting the spell being cast for 5 sec."] = "向目標射出一道切斷魔法的箭，造成36點物理傷害，並打斷正在施放的法術，持續5秒。",
    ["Lowers the Attack Power of the target by 40 for 1 min."] = "使目標的攻擊強度降低40點，持續1分鐘。",
    ["Protects the caster with a holy shield."] = "以神聖之盾保護施法者。",
    ["Pummel the target for 25 damage and interrupt the spell being cast for 5 sec."] = "拳擊目標，造成25點傷害，並打斷正在施放的法術，持續5秒。",
    ["Punctures target's armor, lowering it by 100."] = "刺穿目標的護甲，使其降低100點。",
    ["Reduce your threat to the current target making them less likely to attack you."] = "降低你對當前目標的威脅，使其不太會攻擊你。",
    ["Reduces an enemy's armor by 165. � Stacks up to 3 times."] = "使一名敵人的護甲降低165點。最多疊加3次。",
    ["Reduces targets armor by 300 for 20 sec."] = "使目標的護甲降低300點，持續20秒。",
    ["Sear certain enchanted targets with blazing light causing them to take additional damage from Holy attacks and spells."] = "以熾烈之光燒灼某些被附魔的目標，使它們受到神聖攻擊和法術的額外傷害。",
    ["Sear the target with a vortex of blazing wind, dealing 39 to 59 Holystorm damage."] = "以熾風漩渦燒灼目標，造成39到59點神聖風暴傷害。",
    ["Sear your target's flesh, dealing 67 to 101 Fire damage."] = "燒灼目標的血肉，造成67到101點火焰傷害。",
    ["Slice the target's ankle, slowing movement speed by 30% for 6 sec."] = "切開目標的腳踝，使移動速度降低30%，持續6秒。",
    ["Slices the enemy for 72 to 96 Nature damage."] = "切割敵人，造成72到96點自然傷害。",
    ["Slows the target's movement by 50% for 10 sec."] = "使目標的移動速度降低50%，持續10秒。",
    ["Slows the target's movement speed by 30% and increases the time between their attacks by 25% for 5 sec."] = "使目標的移動速度降低30%，攻擊間隔提高25%，持續5秒。",
    ["Smash the target for 85 damage."] = "砸擊目標，造成85點傷害。",
    ["Smite your target with the power of the holy spring, inflicting 56 Holy damage."] = "以聖泉之力懲擊目標，造成56點神聖傷害。",
    ["Smites an enemy for 30 Holy damage."] = "懲擊一名敵人，造成30點神聖傷害。",
    ["Spell damage taken by target increased by 15% for 5 sec."] = "目標受到的法術傷害提高15%，持續5秒。",
    ["Strike the target with a Flaming Shell for 32 to 46 Fire damage."] = "以烈焰砲彈打擊目標，造成32到46點火焰傷害。",
    ["Strike the target with a Flaming Shell, inflicting 7 Fire damage every 3 sec for 9 sec."] = "以烈焰砲彈打擊目標，在9秒內每3秒造成7點火焰傷害。",
    ["Strike your target with Keeper's Sting for 23 to 33 Nature damage."] = "以守護者之刺打擊目標，造成23到33點自然傷害。",
    ["Tenderize the target, increasing physical damage taken by 1 for 1 min."] = "使目標變軟，受到的物理傷害提高1點，持續1分鐘。",
    ["Venom Shot the target for 23 to 33 Nature damage."] = "對目標施放毒液射擊，造成23到33點自然傷害。",
    ["Naga are Stunned for 2 sec."] = "納迦被擊暈2秒。",
    ["Your attacks have a high chance to poison the target for 8 Nature damage every 3 sec for 9 sec."] = "你的攻擊有較高機率使目標中毒，在9秒內每3秒造成8點自然傷害。",
    ["Causes Wrath to have a 50% chance to restore 35 Mana."] = "使憤怒有50%的機率恢復35點法力。",
    ["Chance on harmful spell cast to reduce target's attack power by 60 for 30 sec."] = "施放有害法術時有機率使目標的攻擊強度降低60點，持續30秒。",
    ["Chance on harmful spell cast to summon a Zombie Troll of Zum'rah for 20 sec."] = "施放有害法術時有機率召喚一隻 Zum'rah 的殭屍食人妖，持續20秒。",
    ["Chance on hit to blast the target for 25 to 31 Fire damage."] = "擊中時有機率轟擊目標，造成25到31點火焰傷害。",
    ["Chance on hit to deal 69 to 81 Arcane damage."] = "擊中時有機率造成69到81點秘法傷害。",
    ["Chance on hit to grant nearby party members 4% increased critical strike chance."] = "擊中時有機率使附近的隊友致命一擊機率提高4%。",
    ["Chance on hit to reduce the mana cost of your next spell cast within 10 sec by 24."] = "擊中時有機率使你在10秒內施放的下一個法術的法力消耗降低24點。",
    ["Chance on hit to restore 32 mana."] = "擊中時有機率恢復32點法力。",
    ["Restores 3 times as much if attacking an Earth Elemental, Golem, or Titan-forged enemy."] = "若攻擊土元素、魔像或泰坦造物，恢復量變為3倍。",
    ["Chance to strike your ranged target with a Shadowbolt for 13 to 19 Shadow damage."] = "有機率以暗影箭打擊你的遠程目標，造成13到19點暗影傷害。",
    ["Harmful spell casts have a chance to steal 112 life from the target enemy over 8 sec."] = "施放有害法術有機率在8秒內從目標敵人身上吸取112點生命。",
    ["Melee attacks deal 98 Fire additional damage against Frozen targets."] = "近戰攻擊對被凍結的目標額外造成98點火焰傷害。",
    ["Reduces all damage taken and chance to be critically hit by 5% in Warsong Gulch."] = "在戰歌峽谷中，受到的所有傷害和被致命一擊的機率降低5%。",
    ["When damaged, has a chance to grant you 1080 armor for 12 sec."] = "受到傷害時，有機率使你的護甲提高1080點，持續12秒。",
    ["When damaged, has a chance to reduce threat level on all enemies by a small amount for 10 sec."] = "受到傷害時，有機率在10秒內小幅降低你對所有敵人的威脅。",
    ["When struck in combat has a 3% chance to heal you for 60 to 100."] = "在戰鬥中被擊中時，有3%的機率為你恢復60到100點生命力。",
    ["When struck in combat has a 5% chance to make you invulnerable to melee damage for 3 sec."] = "在戰鬥中被擊中時，有5%的機率使你免疫近戰傷害，持續3秒。",
    ["This effect can only occur once every 10 sec."] = "此效果每10秒只能觸發一次。",
    ["While in combat, your healing spells have a chance to grant an ally 300 armor for 10 sec."] = "戰鬥中，你的治療法術有機率使一名盟友的護甲提高300點，持續10秒。",
    ["Your Frostbolt spells have a 6% chance to restore 50 mana when cast."] = "你的寒冰箭在施放時有6%的機率恢復50點法力。",
    ["Your Lacerate hits have a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Mangle (Bear)."] = "你的割裂命中有10%的機率重置割碎（熊）的冷卻時間。",
    ["Your healing spells have a 5% chance to remove 1 Poison effect from the target."] = "你的治療法術有5%的機率移除目標身上的1個中毒效果。",
    ["Absorbs 600 magical damage. � Lasts 2 min."] = "吸收600點魔法傷害。持續2分鐘。",
    ["Allows you to look far into the distance."] = "讓你望向遠方。",
    ["Attach a lure to your equipped fishing pole, increasing Fishing by 25 for 10 min."] = "給你裝備的釣竿裝上魚餌，使釣魚提高25點，持續10分鐘。",
    ["Attempts to cure 1 poison effect on the target, and 1 more poison effect every 2 seconds for 8 sec."] = "嘗試治癒目標身上的1個中毒效果，並在8秒內每2秒再治癒1個中毒效果。",
    ["Balance the Powers of the Moon, Emerald Dream, and Wild to learn a new ability."] = "平衡月亮、翡翠夢境與野性之力，以學會一項新技能。",
    ["Channels a bolt of lightning and hurls it towards all enemies in front of the caster causing 189 to 209 Nature damage."] = "引導一道閃電，擲向施法者面前的所有敵人，造成189到209點自然傷害。",
    ["The caster is then surrounded by a barrier of electricit"] = "隨後施法者被一道電屏障包圍。",
    ["Chop nearby Humanoid or Undead corpse in two, restoring 150 Health, 150 Mana, and 15 Rage."] = "把附近的人型或不死生物屍體劈成兩半，恢復150點生命力、150點法力和15點怒氣。",
    ["Combines Jang'thraze and Sang'thraze to form the mighty sword, Sul'thraze."] = "將 Jang'thraze 與 Sang'thraze 合成為強大的劍 Sul'thraze。",
    ["Conjures food to eat."] = "造出食物來吃。",
    ["Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Karazhan."] = "製造一道傳送門，將使用它的小隊成員傳送到卡拉贊。",
    ["Deal 607 Physical damage split between up to 4 nearby enemies."] = "造成607點物理傷害，由附近最多4個敵人分攤。",
    ["Deals 25 Fire damage every 5 sec to all nearby enemies for 15 sec."] = "在15秒內，每5秒對附近所有敵人造成25點火焰傷害。",
    ["Deals 504 Fire damage over 12 sec."] = "在12秒內造成504點火焰傷害。",
    ["Demons and Beasts are Rooted in place for 6 sec."] = "惡魔和野獸被定身6秒。",
    ["Deals 75 Fire damage every 1 sec for 5 sec to all enemies in front of you."] = "在5秒內，每1秒對你面前的所有敵人造成75點火焰傷害。",
    ["Gets you quite drunk too!"] = "還會讓你喝得相當醉！",
    ["Decrease the armor of target by 50 for 1 min."] = "使目標的護甲降低50點，持續1分鐘。",
    ["Dig up a grave."] = "挖開一座墳墓。",
    ["Usable at Raven Hill Cemetery and Scarlet Monastery Graveyard."] = "可在烏鴉嶺墓地和血色修道院墓地使用。",
    ["Escape all immobilizing effects."] = "擺脫所有定身效果。",
    ["Fear all Demons within 15 yds for 6 sec."] = "恐懼15碼內的所有惡魔，持續6秒。",
    ["Gain the ability to walk on water for 5 min.Attacking or taking damage will cancel this effect."] = "獲得水上行走的能力，持續5分鐘。攻擊或受到傷害會取消此效果。",
    ["Heal your pet for 450 to 750."] = "為你的寵物恢復450到750點生命力。",
    ["Increase Rage by 30."] = "怒氣提高30點。",
    ["Increase experience gained from slaying Undead by 10% for 5 min."] = "殺死不死生物獲得的經驗值提高10%，持續5分鐘。",
    ["Increase your run speed by 60% for 10 sec, but deals 100 to 500 damage and drains 100 to 500 mana every 2 seconds."] = "使奔跑速度提高60%，持續10秒，但每2秒造成100到500點傷害並吸取100到500點法力。",
    ["This effect is doubled in Volcanic areas."] = "在火山區域，此效果變為兩倍。",
    ["Increases Fire resistance by 33 and absorbs 465 Fire damage. � Lasts 15 sec."] = "火焰抗性提高33點，並吸收465點火焰傷害。持續15秒。",
    ["Increases all Resistances by 10 and grants Immunity to Fear for 30 sec."] = "所有抗性提高10點，並免疫恐懼，持續30秒。",
    ["Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 130 for 20 sec."] = "使魔法法術和效果造成的傷害和治療提高最多130點，持續20秒。",
    ["Increases healing done by the next 5 spells by up to 450 for 30 sec."] = "使接下來5個法術的治療提高最多450點，持續30秒。",
    ["Increases your Block chance by 8% for 15 sec."] = "使你的格擋機率提高8%，持續15秒。",
    ["This effect is doubled in Strongholds and Cities."] = "在要塞和城市中，此效果變為兩倍。",
    ["Increases your attack speed by 50% for 30 sec."] = "使你的攻擊速度提高50%，持續30秒。",
    ["Increases your chance to Dodge by 3% for 20 sec."] = "使你的閃躲機率提高3%，持續20秒。",
    ["Increases your critical strike chance with all spells and attacks by 5% for 20 sec or until you deal a non-periodic critical effect."] = "使你所有法術和攻擊的致命一擊機率提高5%，持續20秒，或直到你造成一次非週期性的致命效果。",
    ["Increases your effective stealth detection level by 3 for 10 sec, then reduces your effective stealth detection level by 6 for 20 sec."] = "使你的有效潛行偵測等級提高3點，持續10秒，然後使有效潛行偵測等級降低6點，持續20秒。",
    ["Increases your melee and ranged attack power by 280. � Effect lasts for 20 sec."] = "使你的近戰和遠程攻擊強度提高280點。效果持續20秒。",
    ["Lets you walk on water for 1 min."] = "讓你在水上行走，持續1分鐘。",
    ["Marks a target for delivery."] = "標記一個目標以便送達。",
    ["After landing 6 to 8 spells or attacks, deal 467 Fire damage."] = "在命中6到8次法術或攻擊之後，造成467點火焰傷害。",
    ["Number of spells or attacks is halved in Snowy areas."] = "在積雪區域，所需的法術或攻擊次數減半。",
    ["Melee attacks deal an additional 7 Fire damage for 30 sec."] = "近戰攻擊額外造成7點火焰傷害，持續30秒。",
    ["Page Everlook Emergency Services for a Parachute-Priest that will assist in healing allies for 15 sec."] = "呼叫永望鎮緊急服務，召來一位降落傘牧師，協助治療盟友，持續15秒。",
    ["Perform a Propellerstorm, reducing your fall speed for 15 sec and dealing 100% weapon damage to nearby enemies when you land."] = "施展一場螺旋槳風暴，使墜落速度降低，持續15秒，落地時對附近敵人造成100%的武器傷害。",
    ["Purifies the friendly target, removing 1 disease effect and 1 poison effect."] = "淨化友方目標，移除1個疾病效果和1個中毒效果。",
    ["Raise the severed head of Roogug, Horrifying and Silencing all Swine within 15 yds for 5 sec."] = "舉起魯古格被砍下的頭顱，使15碼內的所有豬類恐懼並沉默，持續5秒。",
    ["Reduces your fall speed for 10 sec."] = "使你的墜落速度降低，持續10秒。",
    ["Removes existing Immobilizing effects and makes you immune to Immobilizing effects for 5 sec."] = "移除現有的定身效果，並使你免疫定身，持續5秒。",
    ["Restores 1293 mana over 27 sec. � Must remain seated while drinking."] = "在27秒內恢復1293點法力。飲水時必須保持坐姿。",
    ["Can only be used at 10% health."] = "只能在生命力為10%時使用。",
    ["Slice open and gather from a target Copper, Tin, Silver, or Iron Vein (does not require Mining)."] = "切開並採集目標銅礦、錫礦、銀礦或鐵礦（不需要採礦）。",
    ["Slows nearby enemies by 50% for 10 sec, increased to 80% in Desert areas."] = "使附近敵人減速50%，持續10秒，在沙漠區域提高到80%。",
    ["Stuns target Undead for 6 sec."] = "擊暈目標不死生物，持續6秒。",
    ["Stuns target Worgen for 4 sec."] = "擊暈目標狼人，持續4秒。",
    ["Summons a tracking hound that will protect you for 3 min."] = "召喚一隻追蹤獵犬保護你，持續3分鐘。",
    ["Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler."] = "削弱『污染者』拉瑟萊克的僕從。",
    ["Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."] = "必須靠近目標才能啟動。",
    ["As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool."] = "我對阿魯高魔法的理解越深，對這個倒楣傻瓜的鄙夷就越重。",
    ["I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."] = "我對他所謂療法的研究就快完成了。",
    ["Edwin VanCleef must be assassinated."] = "必須暗殺艾德溫·范克里夫。",
    ["While it saddens me to condemn any man to a death sentence, it is for the greater good of the people of Westfall that VanCleef is laid to rest once and for all."] = "判任何人死刑都讓我難過，但為了西部荒野人民更大的利益，范克里夫必須被徹底解決。",
    ["Here is the final challenge that I will put forth."] = "這是我要提出的最後一項挑戰。",
    ["We've been tracking an elusive tiger for weeks."] = "我們已經追蹤一隻難以捉摸的老虎好幾個星期了。",
    ["I draw my power - my will to continue living and breathing - from the unmitigated hatred I have for the Scourge and all that they have done."] = "我的力量，我繼續活著、繼續呼吸的意志，都來自我對天譴及其所作所為毫不掩飾的憎恨。",
    ["I must warn you, this matter must stay between us."] = "我必須警告你，這件事只能留在我們之間。",
    ["The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."] = "薩特已經夠讓我們丟臉了，而這個又離家園太近。",
    ["Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands."] = "勘察員維爾加現在把他在濕地工地上的原始化石拿在手裡。",
    ["When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."] = "當我發現雷魯之石時，我相信它是解開化石之謎的鑰匙。",
    ["So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus?"] = "所以勘察員想把那塊神秘的化石送到達納蘇斯的探險者協會？",
    ["I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."] = "把他留在這裡、自己離開黑海岸，我覺得不對。",
    ["Strength has left me."] = "力量離開了我。",
    ["Your help is needed!"] = "需要你的幫助！",
    ["Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune."] = "很久以前，這裡是伊露恩的一座大神殿。",
    ["But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."] = "但不幸導致了毀滅：一位上古之神的腐蝕從地下滲出，玷污了神聖的月井。",
    ["This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan."] = "不能讓這個暮光之錘的追隨者完成他的計劃。",
    ["The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature."] = "暮光之錘不理解自然的靈魂。",
    ["They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."] = "他們信仰上古之神——那些很久以前就被擊敗的混亂與毀滅之物。",
    ["This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream."] = "這塊碎片藏著巨大的秘密；它是翡翠夢境的純粹精華。",
    ["However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."] = "然而，我在這塊碎片裡看見的不是夢；這樣的景象，人們會稱之為噩夢。",
    ["We believe they are hiding out in the Dagger Hills, plotting their next move."] = "我們相信他們藏在 Dagger Hills，正在策劃下一步。",
    ["Slay the wretches in the name of The People's Militia."] = "以人民軍的名義殺死這些惡棍。",
